; 5184 = instance_rows^2 (72 x 72). The process shader lays particles out as a grid
; indexed by INDEX, so `amount` and `instance_rows` have to agree or the last row is
; missing / duplicated.
; explosiveness = 1 emits every particle on the same frame: this is a static field
; that happens to be built out of particles, not an emitter.

